---
const items = [
	{
		q: "Is there a Chicago office I can visit?",
		a: "This brand does not publish a storefront address or a phone number. The Chicago Marketing Agency serves the city and the suburbs. Bidview Marketing, in the Libertyville and Chicago area, does the work.",
	},
	{
		q: "Will you guarantee a ranking or a lead count?",
		a: "No. Rankings and lead volume depend on the site, the offer, and the market. The figures on this site are published Bidview Marketing results. They are not a forecast for your company.",
	},
	{
		q: "Do I have to hire you to hear back?",
		a: "No. The audit is free. A written scope comes after, and only if the work is a fit. You can say no.",
	},
	{
		q: "What if you cannot help?",
		a: "You should hear that. Mike McNamara, a Bidview Marketing client, has said publicly that the team turns down work it does not think it can help. That is the standard for this audit too.",
	},
];
---

<section class="objections" aria-labelledby="objections-heading">
	<div class="container objections-grid">
		<div>
			<p class="eyebrow">Before you send the form</p>
			<h2 id="objections-heading">Straight answers</h2>
			<p>The audit is the only ask on this site. These are the questions people raise before they send it.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="objections-list">
			{items.map((item) => (
				<details>
					<summary>{item.q}</summary>
					<p>{item.a}</p>
				</details>
			))}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.objections {
		padding: 72px 0;
		background: var(--sand, var(--off-white));
	}
	.objections-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
		gap: 48px;
		align-items: start;
	}
	.objections h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
		margin-bottom: 12px;
	}
	.objections-grid > div > p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		max-width: 36ch;
	}
	.objections-list details {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		background: var(--white);
	}
	.objections-list details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
	.objections-list summary {
		cursor: pointer;
		list-style: none;
		padding: 16px 18px;
		font-weight: 650;
		font-size: 1.02rem;
	}
	.objections-list summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
	.objections-list summary::after {
		content: "+";
		float: right;
		color: var(--brick, var(--red));
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.objections-list details[open] summary::after { content: "–"; }
	.objections-list p {
		padding: 0 18px 16px;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.objections { padding: 48px 0; }
		.objections-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
	}
</style>
